    "text": "The harmonic mean&nbsp;of two positive numbers <math><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><mi>b</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> their arithmeitc mean&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;the geometric mean&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
